# Upload filter for `gcloud builds submit` (see `make train-image`).
#
# gcloud reads THIS file, not .dockerignore. Without it the build context tarball
# would include the 1 GB .venv and 139 MB web/node_modules and upload them on
# every build — .dockerignore would then discard them, but only after they had
# already crossed the wire.
#
# Including .dockerignore rather than restating it keeps the two from drifting:
# what the build context excludes and what the upload excludes should be the same
# set. Verify with:
#
#     gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
#
#!include:.dockerignore
